WEBVTT

00:00:00.210 --> 00:00:04.400
You showed some good moves for a second there, but didn't pan out.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:06.040
I'm pretty disappointed.

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:08.050
Being a man or a woman is beside the point.

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:10.880
It's the person's skill that makes the difference.

00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:12.260
Waste of my time.

00:00:12.260 --> 00:00:16.260
You could all bundle your genes into a nice variety pack and I'd still pass.

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:17.730
But that was nipped in the bud.

00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:19.850
In that moment, you were already over.

00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:22.810
As I thought, the one whose genes I'll receive...

00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:24.810
...appears to be you!

00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:29.530
How many times must you crush something precious to me before you're satisfied?

00:00:29.890 --> 00:00:34.700
You know, Crawly, I don't remember how Mom looked when she smiled.

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:38.010
But this house was filled with her kindness.

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:42.210
I'll do it for myself. That's all.

00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:46.000
I'm going to cut those ties you are unable to let go of.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:49.140
I became arrogant.

00:00:49.140 --> 00:00:51.270
Thinking of myself as someone chosen...

00:00:51.270 --> 00:00:53.310
And then I lost everything.

00:00:53.310 --> 00:00:54.860
I cursed people.

00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:58.300
That includes you, Falcon.

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:00.840
So, are you gonna kill me, Iceman?

00:01:00.840 --> 00:01:04.150
No, I won't kill you.

00:01:04.150 --> 00:01:06.950
I'll win against you and I'll leave you alive; then, I'll leave you behind me.

00:01:06.950 --> 00:01:08.810
You've changed!

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:12.640
Someone taught me to not run away, that's all.

00:01:14.180 --> 00:01:15.320
I'm gonna do it, Rouge.

00:01:16.070 --> 00:01:18.440
I'm gonna win the finals tomorrow.

00:01:18.440 --> 00:01:20.970
And after I win, I'm going to the moon!

00:01:20.970 --> 00:01:22.320
Just you wait!

00:01:25.090 --> 00:01:27.350
Bloodlines, genes...

00:01:28.130 --> 00:01:32.180
Mom, I'm going to settle my fight once and for all.

00:01:35.340 --> 00:01:42.600
SPLASH, DASH, CRASH!

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:41.880
At long last, the championship game is tomorrow.

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:45.720
The furious fight between Team Basquash and King of Kings

00:01:45.720 --> 00:01:47.060
will bring the tournament to a close.

00:01:47.830 --> 00:01:51.240
Wild excitement, rhythm, jubilation...

00:01:51.980 --> 00:01:54.240
The whole town was drunk on Basquash;

00:01:54.240 --> 00:01:56.680
no one slept that night.

00:01:57.820 --> 00:02:02.700
After the climax, this town will be reborn.

00:02:04.160 --> 00:02:06.570
There shouldn't be any reason to worry, but...

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:11.760
The storm is near.

00:02:25.690 --> 00:02:28.600
Watch over me. I swear we'll win.

00:02:31.870 --> 00:02:41.400
Kill him! Kill him! Kill him!

00:02:55.020 --> 00:02:56.790
I'm sleepy.

00:02:56.790 --> 00:02:58.010
Ganz!

00:02:58.010 --> 00:03:00.580
Can you hand me the part that's lying over there?

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:05.580
Ganz never came back from the errand Miss Haruka sent him on last night.

00:03:06.630 --> 00:03:08.430
An errand for Haruka?

00:03:15.300 --> 00:03:16.480
You're up early.

00:03:17.030 --> 00:03:18.400
Well, yes...

00:03:19.710 --> 00:03:20.230
Here.

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:24.360
Thank you.

00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:27.830
Let me have a look at that.

00:03:27.830 --> 00:03:29.440
It's fine, really...

00:03:33.780 --> 00:03:34.820
It's burning hot.

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:40.180
Good morning, slobs of the world!

00:03:40.670 --> 00:03:43.330
Out of a ridiculously huge number of teams,

00:03:43.330 --> 00:03:46.270
those who survived to make it to today's final are...

00:03:46.270 --> 00:03:51.310
The one-and-only, the world-renowned, Falcon Lightwing!

00:03:51.310 --> 00:03:54.020
His lightning reactions matched only by his judgment, BB!

00:03:54.020 --> 00:03:57.120
A fortress of perfect defense, JP!

00:03:59.120 --> 00:04:04.450
Ranged against them are: the world's foremost Debt King, Dan JD a.k.a. Dunk Mask!

00:04:04.450 --> 00:04:07.870
The Platinum Hurricane, Sela D. Miranda!

00:04:07.870 --> 00:04:11.620
The Freezing Inferno, Iceman Hotty!

00:04:11.620 --> 00:04:16.600
Okay! It's Team Basquash... Huh?

00:04:17.750 --> 00:04:19.460
Hey! Wait up!

00:04:19.460 --> 00:04:20.750
Oh, it's Dan.

00:04:21.270 --> 00:04:22.720
Mr. Dan!

00:04:22.720 --> 00:04:24.800
What the hell was keeping you?!

00:04:25.760 --> 00:04:28.010
You want to get disqualified?!

00:04:28.010 --> 00:04:30.100
Yeah, so what about her?

00:04:31.600 --> 00:04:32.850
Sela?

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:37.390
Sela!

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:39.570
Miss Sela!

00:04:40.140 --> 00:04:40.980
Coming!

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:45.120
Sela...

00:04:54.230 --> 00:04:56.250
All right, now that we've gathered all the players,

00:04:56.250 --> 00:04:58.840
it's time, as always, to tell you where the baskets are!

00:04:58.840 --> 00:05:02.360
First facing the land, take a look at that huge windmill!

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:04.230
Wait, what's that?!

00:05:04.230 --> 00:05:06.910
The basket has been attached to one of the center turbine's blades.

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:09.890
That's right, today's hoop is a moving target!

00:05:09.890 --> 00:05:12.270
So, where's the one facing the sea positioned?

00:05:12.270 --> 00:05:13.650
D-Don't tell me-

00:05:13.650 --> 00:05:14.710
That's right!

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:17.270
It's outside the Sky Lounge of the Shutoran Hotel!

00:05:18.330 --> 00:05:21.710
That one's incredibly high up!

00:05:21.710 --> 00:05:22.950
S-Scary!

00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:26.180
If you space out like you did a moment ago,

00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:27.930
the basket's gonna run away from you.

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:30.670
And if you rush in hell-for-leather like usual,

00:05:30.670 --> 00:05:31.990
you'll run straight into a pillar.

00:05:31.990 --> 00:05:32.490
What?!

00:05:32.490 --> 00:05:34.060
And what do you mean by that?!

00:05:34.890 --> 00:05:36.740
It takes too much effort to explain.

00:05:39.520 --> 00:05:40.520
Iceman,

00:05:41.870 --> 00:05:43.540
I can already see which team will lose.

00:05:52.150 --> 00:05:54.930
Now, Dan, Sela, let's go.

00:05:54.930 --> 00:05:55.480
Sure!

00:05:55.480 --> 00:05:55.970
Okay.

00:05:56.380 --> 00:05:58.380
Bel, let's not waste any time getting them ready.

00:05:59.700 --> 00:06:01.090
A pitch-black storm...

00:06:04.610 --> 00:06:06.040
Uncertain clouds...

00:06:16.570 --> 00:06:18.760
What a nice sunny day.

00:06:19.210 --> 00:06:21.500
Okay, dudes and dudettes, here we go!

00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:25.340
The whistle of destiny will sound through Turbine City!

00:06:26.610 --> 00:06:29.890
This may be the final match, but the rules remain the same!

00:06:29.890 --> 00:06:32.790
Where will the jump ball fly in from?!

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:34.530
Who knows!

00:06:34.530 --> 00:06:36.230
Speaking of which, game...

00:06:36.230 --> 00:06:38.350
start!

00:06:49.720 --> 00:06:50.280
What?!

00:06:52.470 --> 00:06:53.200
Shit!

00:06:57.800 --> 00:07:00.320
Destroy!

00:07:06.950 --> 00:07:08.200
You won't make it!

00:07:08.200 --> 00:07:09.170
Yes, I will!

00:07:09.170 --> 00:07:10.490
No, you won't!

00:07:10.490 --> 00:07:14.040
Yes, I... won't!

00:07:16.880 --> 00:07:18.840
What do you think you're doing, Dan?!

00:07:25.060 --> 00:07:26.320
Here ya go, BB!

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:26.940
Falcon!

00:07:26.940 --> 00:07:28.070
All right!

00:07:32.400 --> 00:07:34.050
Goal!

00:07:34.050 --> 00:07:37.070
First to score is King of Kings!

00:07:39.620 --> 00:07:40.800
Shit!

00:07:41.470 --> 00:07:42.690
They're good.

00:07:44.590 --> 00:07:45.770
Why that...

00:07:47.080 --> 00:07:48.200
Mom!

00:07:51.230 --> 00:07:52.470
Pardon me,

00:07:52.470 --> 00:07:54.510
<i>Milady.</i>

00:07:55.010 --> 00:07:57.100
You...

00:07:58.440 --> 00:08:01.520
But destroying the whole town to rebuild it...

00:08:01.520 --> 00:08:03.760
That's pretty extreme, Sir.

00:08:04.240 --> 00:08:05.940
Some of the townspeople must've been against it, right?

00:08:06.590 --> 00:08:08.290
That means nothing.

00:08:08.290 --> 00:08:10.330
Someday, they'll understand.

00:08:11.380 --> 00:08:12.980
This was a good opportunity.

00:08:15.230 --> 00:08:17.180
They're really going for it.

00:08:17.180 --> 00:08:18.330
Mr. Roberto!

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:20.580
Team Basquash lost the first chance to score,

00:08:20.580 --> 00:08:21.570
and now they're even further behind...

00:08:21.570 --> 00:08:22.370
Can't you see he's working?!

00:08:22.780 --> 00:08:24.140
I beg your pardon.

00:08:24.140 --> 00:08:26.540
But since the young lady is playing in this match...

00:08:27.030 --> 00:08:28.160
Young lady?

00:08:44.530 --> 00:08:45.570
C'mon in!

00:08:45.570 --> 00:08:47.440
Nice weather, huh?

00:08:47.850 --> 00:08:52.240
Even in these circumstances, King of Kings' attacks show no signs of weakening!

00:08:52.240 --> 00:08:54.560
On the contrary, this seems to be giving them even more energy!

00:08:54.560 --> 00:08:57.880
Too bad Team Basquash is still dragging!

00:08:57.880 --> 00:09:00.390
Ahh! Dunk Mask fell down again!

00:09:00.390 --> 00:09:03.630
Is the rain giving you problems moving right, Dunk Mask?!

00:09:03.630 --> 00:09:04.980
Thanks!

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:12.960
There you are!

00:09:27.310 --> 00:09:31.250
Sorry! Bad footing don't bother us.

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:31.860
Is that so?

00:09:35.230 --> 00:09:37.150
Dan! Run!

00:09:37.240 --> 00:09:39.120
You don't have to tell me!

00:09:43.030 --> 00:09:45.080
Shit, I can't stop!

00:09:45.080 --> 00:09:46.250
It's mine!

00:09:46.250 --> 00:09:47.580
Not a chance!

00:09:55.420 --> 00:09:56.470
Goal!

00:09:56.470 --> 00:09:59.630
King of Kings scores yet again!

00:10:03.590 --> 00:10:07.530
This is dragging your family name through the mud, <i>Milady</i>.

00:10:16.110 --> 00:10:17.030
Welcome back!

00:10:17.030 --> 00:10:23.320
The first half of the OCB Championship finals between King of Kings and Team Basquash is over,

00:10:23.320 --> 00:10:24.530
and we're now in halftime!

00:10:27.870 --> 00:10:30.490
All I'm saying is, it's <i>way</i> high, <i>way</i> slippery,

00:10:30.490 --> 00:10:33.380
and there is no <i>way</i> I can basquat like this!

00:10:33.380 --> 00:10:35.180
Ah, you're driving me nuts!

00:10:35.180 --> 00:10:37.100
Shut it for a while!

00:10:37.100 --> 00:10:39.240
Hey, is there anything we can do?

00:10:40.690 --> 00:10:41.580
...Nothing.

00:10:41.580 --> 00:10:42.930
"Nothing"? C'mon...

00:10:42.930 --> 00:10:45.690
I'm gonna die! Die! I'm gonna die!

00:10:45.690 --> 00:10:47.360
Yeah, just go ahead and die!

00:10:55.630 --> 00:10:57.680
Yeah, hello...

00:10:59.190 --> 00:11:00.280
Out of batteries, huh?

00:11:01.580 --> 00:11:03.080
That idiot Ganz...

00:11:16.500 --> 00:11:18.800
Second half, start!

00:11:18.800 --> 00:11:20.390
Those bastards, underestimating us...

00:11:24.990 --> 00:11:25.680
It's not over yet!

00:11:34.770 --> 00:11:36.570
Another basket!

00:11:36.570 --> 00:11:38.940
How many points are they planning to get?

00:11:38.940 --> 00:11:40.340
It's 40 to 12!

00:11:40.340 --> 00:11:42.400
So one-sided!

00:11:42.400 --> 00:11:43.900
They aren't holding back!

00:11:43.900 --> 00:11:44.770
It's the rain!

00:11:44.770 --> 00:11:46.740
The rain is taking sides with King of Kings

00:11:46.740 --> 00:11:48.870
and crowning them king again!

00:11:54.530 --> 00:11:56.730
Dunk Mask is flat on his back yet again!

00:11:57.200 --> 00:11:59.420
Has Team Basquash reached their limit?

00:11:59.420 --> 00:12:00.780
No, no, not yet!

00:12:00.780 --> 00:12:02.370
The Platinum Hurricane is...

00:12:02.370 --> 00:12:03.720
She slipped again!

00:12:03.720 --> 00:12:06.120
But the Freezing Inferno is coming up fast...

00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:07.400
{bg}The Destroy is off-target!

00:12:07.400 --> 00:12:08.300
Yo!

00:12:08.590 --> 00:12:09.690
Mr. Ganz!

00:12:09.690 --> 00:12:13.280
Hey, Ganz! Where have you been that you had to desert us at a time like this?

00:12:13.280 --> 00:12:17.450
Where was I? I was picking up something for Haruka, that's all.

00:12:18.940 --> 00:12:20.630
Looks like I made it just in ti-

00:12:20.630 --> 00:12:23.700
Falcon scores again!

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:30.220
Those are...

00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:31.840
They're just what they look like.

00:12:31.840 --> 00:12:33.510
These are all they need.

00:12:33.510 --> 00:12:38.020
But how? We can't stop time.

00:12:38.020 --> 00:12:39.130
I'll go.

00:12:42.880 --> 00:12:45.300
If I'm gonna slip no matter what, this is how I'll do it!

00:12:45.300 --> 00:12:48.950
I see. A nice idea.

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:49.980
But...

00:12:49.980 --> 00:12:50.390
What?!

00:12:51.580 --> 00:12:52.930
G-Get outta the way!

00:12:54.970 --> 00:12:56.220
Iceman.

00:12:56.220 --> 00:12:58.380
So in the end, the only teams that would take you on

00:12:58.380 --> 00:12:59.530
are no better than this.

00:13:01.820 --> 00:13:03.400
Try me, Falcon!

00:13:08.640 --> 00:13:09.820
Iceman!

00:13:09.820 --> 00:13:10.890
Sela too!

00:13:10.890 --> 00:13:12.990
Run where I tell you to!

00:13:15.200 --> 00:13:18.290
Even a legend can end before he starts if he can't stand up.

00:13:18.290 --> 00:13:20.580
Now, don't be too hasty.

00:13:22.250 --> 00:13:24.200
Stomp down harder, Dan!

00:13:24.200 --> 00:13:26.350
I'm having trouble 'cause I can't stomp harder!

00:13:26.350 --> 00:13:28.280
Dan! Pull back, Dan!

00:13:28.280 --> 00:13:31.420
The other two are behind you! You all need to swing by the central plaza!

00:13:31.420 --> 00:13:31.930
Behind me?

00:13:33.230 --> 00:13:34.220
W-What's going on?

00:13:34.220 --> 00:13:37.260
Just tag along with Sela and Iceman.

00:13:38.060 --> 00:13:39.560
Are you ready, Alan?

00:13:40.990 --> 00:13:41.830
Here they come!

00:13:41.830 --> 00:13:42.360
Ready!

00:13:43.030 --> 00:13:43.730
What's that?

00:13:45.730 --> 00:13:47.930
That's right, keep coming.

00:13:48.360 --> 00:13:52.050
Yes, just like that...

00:13:52.050 --> 00:13:53.120
Okay, now!

00:13:56.660 --> 00:13:57.980
Miss Sela!

00:13:58.330 --> 00:13:59.730
Mr. Iceman!

00:14:00.490 --> 00:14:02.710
Those are... new shoes!

00:14:03.630 --> 00:14:05.010
Excellent, Princess!

00:14:05.010 --> 00:14:06.320
I'm not done yet!

00:14:06.320 --> 00:14:08.800
Here I go, Mr. Dan!

00:14:13.970 --> 00:14:15.180
You hear me?

00:14:15.180 --> 00:14:16.890
There's still time.

00:14:16.890 --> 00:14:20.170
Show them your true power!

00:14:21.180 --> 00:14:21.690
All right!

00:14:21.690 --> 00:14:23.230
Time to basquat!

00:14:23.230 --> 00:14:24.940
It's too late now!

00:14:27.150 --> 00:14:27.990
Gotcha!

00:14:29.610 --> 00:14:30.530
Hold it!

00:14:31.610 --> 00:14:34.370
What?! She's screening him?!

00:14:35.970 --> 00:14:37.290
Goal! Goal!

00:14:37.720 --> 00:14:39.500
Dunk Mask scores!

00:14:39.500 --> 00:14:40.580
Sweet!

00:14:40.580 --> 00:14:41.670
Awesome, Mr. Dan!

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:54.470
This wasn't how she moved before!

00:14:55.980 --> 00:14:57.430
I'm done playing around!

00:14:57.890 --> 00:14:59.550
Have a nice day.

00:14:59.550 --> 00:15:00.750
Sela, look.

00:15:05.860 --> 00:15:06.840
No way.

00:15:06.840 --> 00:15:08.230
Aren't you happy?

00:15:10.230 --> 00:15:11.990
Let him watch me win.

00:15:11.990 --> 00:15:16.980
And then, I'll make him regret how cruel he was to Mom!

00:15:45.980 --> 00:15:48.220
It's stopped raining...

00:15:49.070 --> 00:15:51.820
Who's gonna decide the final score?!

00:15:51.820 --> 00:15:53.980
Me, duh!

00:15:53.980 --> 00:15:55.160
Not a chance!

00:15:57.230 --> 00:15:58.240
That bird bastard!

00:15:58.240 --> 00:15:59.040
Dan!

00:15:59.040 --> 00:16:00.980
Trust me and run towards the basket!

00:16:18.650 --> 00:16:20.100
Mr. Iceman?

00:16:22.420 --> 00:16:24.420
So he's reached his limit.

00:16:32.380 --> 00:16:35.250
N-Not yet!

00:16:58.500 --> 00:17:01.450
Iceman! Iceman! {I= galdy check}

00:17:03.850 --> 00:17:05.100
Iceman!

00:17:11.830 --> 00:17:17.530
Des... troy!

00:17:18.740 --> 00:17:20.870
BB! Throw me in front of the goal!

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:31.620
Nice pass!

00:17:36.340 --> 00:17:38.400
I'll swear I'll decide it!

00:17:41.930 --> 00:17:43.510
Like I'll let you!

00:17:43.510 --> 00:17:44.810
Shit!

00:17:46.040 --> 00:17:47.930
What's wrong, Dunk Mask?

00:17:47.930 --> 00:17:49.730
The basket will get away from you!

00:17:50.480 --> 00:17:51.600
Sela!

00:17:53.730 --> 00:17:54.820
What?!

00:17:58.400 --> 00:18:00.780
Dan <i>passed</i>...

00:18:00.780 --> 00:18:01.530
He passed!

00:18:02.850 --> 00:18:05.440
Nice... pass!

00:18:06.250 --> 00:18:08.870
Go for it, Hurricane!

00:18:08.870 --> 00:18:11.680
Basquash!

00:18:12.870 --> 00:18:14.630
It's over!

00:18:14.630 --> 00:18:17.730
Goal! Goal! Goal!

00:18:17.730 --> 00:18:20.640
50 to 48!

00:18:20.640 --> 00:18:23.320
The OCB Championship goes to...

00:18:23.320 --> 00:18:24.310
Team...

00:18:24.310 --> 00:18:27.220
Basquash!

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:32.310
We did it! We did it! We did it!

00:18:56.080 --> 00:18:56.830
How's that?

00:18:57.270 --> 00:19:01.100
I'm my mother's daughter and I did this; the child of the woman you called useless and threw away.

00:19:10.610 --> 00:19:11.680
What's up?

00:19:12.560 --> 00:19:13.960
What is this...

00:19:14.450 --> 00:19:17.470
Dark and grief-stricken storm clouds...

00:19:20.530 --> 00:19:22.590
That was fantastic, Dan.

00:19:23.290 --> 00:19:25.330
At long last, the legend is born.

00:19:26.880 --> 00:19:28.380
The legend, eh?

00:19:34.990 --> 00:19:36.520
So, here I come, finally.

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:38.230
Just you wait, moon.

00:19:39.150 --> 00:19:40.160
What's that?

00:19:45.200 --> 00:19:46.460
Who're you?

